OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOccasional
OL,6,Fshowers will continue across northern
OL,7,Fareas especially, with a few also
OL,8,Freaching the Solway coast, though the
OL,9,Fbest of the clear spells will be here.
OL,10,FWinds easing further.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FBright or sunny intervals
OL,13,Fand a few showers these mostly across
OL,14,Fthe Lothians. Less windy and a little
OL,15,Fmilder too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
