OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FThursday will be mainly dry, though
OL,7,Fquite cloudy with a few light showers.
OL,8,FSome sunshine around too. A dry start
OL,9,FFriday then rain spreading from west.
OL,10,FRain easing later Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
